;; A windmill driving another machine's millstones by a shaft (issue #78):
;; the free sails (no stones of their own) turn the dry mill's wheel, whose
;; stones grind against 8171 N·m. Predicted: both settle at 14.32 rpm, the
;; shaft carrying 8171 N·m and 12.26 kW (racket/machines/dry-mill.rkt).
(world linked-shaft
  (place sails free-sails (at 0 0 0))
  (place mill dry-mill (at 16 0 6))
  (link drive shaft (from sails sails) (to mill wheel) (ratio 1)))
